  {
   "t": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 757,
   "w": 534,
   "h": 26,
   "html": "<h3>Hello, this is my forth week of the Scad x Harbor blog!</h3>",
   "plain": "Hello, this is my forth week of the Scad x Harbor blog!",
   "head": true
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 794,
   "w": 285,
   "h": 26,
   "html": "<h3>Feedback From Mentors:</h3>",
   "plain": "Feedback From Mentors:",
   "head": true
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 831,
   "w": 930,
   "h": 580,
   "html": "<p>Vi:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shaders on watch? Looks like 2 shaders&mdash;more separation of pieces</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 2 tracking: lock down layout and camera!</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 01: unbalanced</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Hailey:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>The design changed well on the last shot</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 04 not composed? - Bubbles are dark and solid</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 01: Frames need to feel stronger</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Kyle: </p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Flames should feel like torch</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 01 and 02: Tracking will be changing; grade down the hands, tighter shot 01</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 02: remove hands (all CG)&mdash;tighter in on pour</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 04: lighting improvements, more dramatic</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 05: Match lighting, metal band less shiny</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Start grading shots/reframe​</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Billy:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Cut off hands</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Rolex: read up on the metals</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Molly: </p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Shot 03: How does it connect Flip 4 and 3?</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Skip shot 5 or 3</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<p>Watch YouTube videos of watch parts (naked watchmakers)</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>​</p>",
   "plain": "Vi:\n\n\n\t\n\tShaders on watch? Looks like 2 shaders&mdash;more separation of pieces\n",
   "head": false
  },
  {
