  {
   "t": "text",
   "x": 25,
   "y": 1486,
   "w": 930,
   "h": 131,
   "html": "<p>After discussion, we decided to change Shot 01 and Shot 02 to full CG. For Shot 02, we decided to show molten platinum being poured into the mold, the shape of which is part of the watch. The next shot will feature water being poured onto the watch, followed by the bubble shot. This change makes the storyline flow more smoothly, and the viewer can better understand the process of creating a watch. Also, we deleted Shot 05, which is about composing a watch.</p>",
